null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-07-30T07:24:46Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T09:26:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.5.beta4.official [2d113cc22] and v4.4.1.stable\nNo other versions were tested.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe lengths of the streams in AudioStreamPlaylist are unaffected by AudioServer.playback_speed_scale. If speed is less than 1, it goes to the next stream too early, and if speed is more than 1, there's silence between the streams.\nTransition times should match stream lengths.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Assign an AudioStreamPlaylist to an AudioStreamPlayer.\n- Add any audio streams to the AudioStreamPlaylist.\n- Set AudioServer.playback_speed_scale to 0.5 or 2.0 or something.\n- Play the audio.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[PlaylistBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21503771/PlaylistBug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109113/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109113/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}